{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47266","headline":"游仙二十四首 三 · 吴筠","name":"游仙二十四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"愍俗从迁谢，寻仙去沦没。\n三元有真人，与我生道骨。\n凌晨吸丹景，入夜饮黄月。\n百关弥调畅，方寸益清越。\n栖神合虚无，洞览周恍惚。\n不觉随玉皇，焚香诣金阙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47266.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47266","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}